(text "All eight output series links R128..R135 are DNP: coil model, polarity, 5V current and maximum dwell protection unresolved.\nMIC4427 is a candidate buffer, not a qualified automotive ignition driver. No coils or loads may be attached.\nThe MCU-side names IGN1..8 are distinct from harness-side IGN1_LOGIC_OUT..8.\nPC13 load must remain below ST restrictions; MIC input typ6pF/max1uA, 100k pulldown adds33uA at3.3V." (at 25.4 375 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "32f2d879-d22d-54db-ab6e-52203696194e"))
